Resumable original IOP bootstrap on the existing kernel and console clock.
Native module initializers and original post-boot callbacks retain their thread context across SIF waits.
EE MMIO and SIF imports share the same flags; remove the legacy hard-coded SMFLAG response.
References: ps2dev/ps2sdk threadman thcommon.c, sifman.c and loadcore.c; PCSX2 IopMem.cpp/HwWrite.cpp.
Maintainer approved this execution model on 2026-11-15.

